"info_how_it_works" = "How it works";
"info_how_it_works_description" = "Telescan uses Bluetooth to find people nearby, then lets you contact them through Telegram. The app continues searching in the background: you can minimize it, but do not quit it. When a Telescan user is detected nearby, the app sends a notification.";
"proprietaryLicense" = "Copyright © 2021 - 2026 Ruslan Chukavin. All rights reserved.";
"info_story" = "Every day, we find ourselves near people we could have talked to, gotten to know, spent an evening with, or one day remembered the encounter as something important. We cross paths on the metro, at school, in cafés, and on the street. We look at one another and almost always simply keep walking.\n\nToo many good stories end before they have a chance to begin. Telescan is an attempt to give those encounters another chance.";
